SUMMARY:Xero: Takes effect
DESCRIPTION:Xero's new terms let it demand a government ID and a biometric
  face scan\, and suspend or close accounts that don't pass. US customers 
 also get new arbitration rules\, including a one-year limit on claims.\n\
